## Goal
- Finish the in-progress `typescript_strictness_20260426` track by fixing all remaining server TypeScript type errors.

## Constraints & Preferences
- Follow the autonomous prompt protocol: commit dirty work, finish in-progress phases, run tests/build after batches.
- `exactOptionalPropertyTypes` and `noUncheckedIndexedAccess` are enabled in `server/tsconfig.json` and must remain enabled.
- Preserve runtime behavior; use non-null assertions (`!`) or casts only where safe.

## Progress
### Done
- Committed dirty `measure/output.log`.
- App workspace verified clean: 0 errors, build passes.
- Fixed type errors in 20+ server source files:
  - `dashboardRoutes.ts`, `FilenameParsingService.ts`, `SubtitleVariantRepository.ts`
  - `WantedSearchService.ts`, `SeriesMonitoringService.ts`, `smartDefaults.ts`
  - `UpdateService.ts`, `PlaybackRepository.ts`, `ImportListRepository.ts`
  - `DownloadClientRepository.ts`, `CustomFormatRepository.ts`, `TemplateRuntime.ts`
